<title>UK: Bayerhypo sets NZ$100 mln 3-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Bayerhypo sets NZ$100 mln 3-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Toronto Dominion, Bayer Hypo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.50 PCT  MATURITY    06.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.915   PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ/DE</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS(K) 1-10-100 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.0</p>
